  "intuition": "Add a small positive margin inside the preference logit (lpw-lpl) before logsigmoid. This encourages a non-trivial separation between winner and loser (instead of just lpw>lpl), often improving validation by reducing ambiguity/noise around near-ties while keeping the stable, bounded logsigmoid form.",
